{"ref":"BDB, סַ֫עַר","hw":"סַ֫עַר","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">סַ֫עַר</span></big>  <strong>n.m.</strong> <sup><a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 23:19\" href=\"/Jeremiah.23.19\">Je 23:19</a></sup> <strong>tempest;</strong>—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">ס׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Amos 1:14\" href=\"/Amos.1.14\">Am 1:14</a> + 5 times; <span dir=\"rtl\">סָ֑עַר</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 55:9\" href=\"/Psalms.55.9\">ψ 55:9</a>; pl. sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">סַעֲרֶיךָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 83:16\" href=\"/Psalms.83.16\">83:16</a>;—<em>tempest</em>, especially fig.: of passionate acts of men, <span dir=\"rtl\">מֵרוּחַ סֹעָה מִסָּ֑עַר</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 55:9\" href=\"/Psalms.55.9\">ψ 55:9</a> (<span dir=\"rtl\">מִסּ׳</span> here awkward, without <span dir=\"rtl\">ו</span>); of <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span>’s wrath <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 23:19\" href=\"/Jeremiah.23.19\">Je 23:19</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">(ס׳ מִתְחוֹלֵל)</span>, cf. <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 25:32\" href=\"/Jeremiah.25.32\">25:32</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 30:23\" href=\"/Jeremiah.30.23\">30:23</a>; <em>tempest</em> as instr. of <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span>’s wrath, <a data-ref=\"Psalms 83:16\" href=\"/Psalms.83.16\">ψ 83:16</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">סוּפָה</span>); v. also <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּסַעַר בְּיוֹם סוּפָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Amos 1:14\" href=\"/Amos.1.14\">Am 1:14</a> and <a data-ref=\"Jonah 1:4\" href=\"/Jonah.1.4\">Jon 1:4</a>, <a data-ref=\"Jonah 1:12\" href=\"/Jonah.1.12\">12</a>.","next":"BDB, סְעָרָה","prev":"BDB, סָעַר"}